==============================================================================
5. ANSWER
==============================================================================
  lightest design meeting E >= 2500 MPa (HP-MT):
    eta = 0.9700 (t/R = 0.0300); vf = 0.6000; rho = 0.6051 g/cm^3; E = 2860.4 MPa
    HS band at that point [2860, 2861] MPa -> estimate inside, target below the upper bound: feasible.
  caveat: HP-MT is an idealised estimate; HP-DS is lower, and measured syntactic-foam moduli
          typically fall 20-40% below HP-MT (matrix porosity, particle breakage, imperfect
          bonding). Treat the optimum as an upper-bound-of-performance design point.
